		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060080"},
		line=1254,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I rouse myself after two hours of light sleep.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Across from me, Akari continues to slumber without tossing or turning in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Coming into contact with Himi-no-Mikoto's soul must have taken a great toll on her body.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnm... ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Is she having a bad dream?",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"I want her to at least be able to sleep without being burdened by the weight of her responsibilities.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"...But I suppose that's too much to ask.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Knowing how strong her sense of responsibility is, she must be confronting Kahaku and Himi-no-Mikoto right now, even in her dreams.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's all right. I'm here for you.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"With my fingertip, I tuck a stray lock of her hair behind her ear.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Zzz... zzz...”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Akari's breathing stills ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"I've heard that skin-to-skin contact makes people feel at ease.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"It seems like that's true for her, at least.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"In that case, perhaps I should hold her hand.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Would that be going too far, as her vassal?",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Whenever I leap across the rooftops, I'm always carrying her in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"Holding her hand should be nothing in comparison.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"All I want is for Akari to sleep as soundly as possible.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"I have absolutely nothing to feel guilty about.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Who am I even trying to make excuses to?)”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Reaching out my hand only to pull away several times, I finally grab hold of Akari's hand through her blanket.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nmmh...”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nh!”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I immediately pull my hand back.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Zzz... zzz...”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ph-Phew...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Letting out a sigh of relief, I gingerly take up her hand again.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"It's warm.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Though separated by the blanket between us, her touch warms me to the core.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"It dawns on me that this is what I've wanted for so very long.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Love, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"The word rattles around inside my chest as I speak it aloud.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"But rather than feeling incongruous, it settles comfortably into place.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Like a key fitting into a lock, it feels perfectly right.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Akari is a beautiful person.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Living in full awareness of her weakness, she nonetheless strives to become stronger and stronger.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"That's why everything about her─her voice, her gaze, her every breath─feels as radiant as the sun.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"It's no wonder I can't take my eyes off her.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"“You think a warrior would ever lay a hand on his lord?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I remember having said those exact words to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I'm a failure of a warrior.)”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nmh...”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Akari slowly blinks her eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mmmmm, that was a good sleep.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You barely slept for three hours.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's okay. I feel good as new.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"With an easy smile, Akari leaps to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Her footsteps are brisk and light, showing no signs of fatigue.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anything happen while I was asleep?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nope. Nobody so much as entered the building.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's a relief.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Akari replies before sinking into a pensive mood.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin, how 'bout we step outside and get some fresh air?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's not every day we get the whole school to ourselves,\ny'know?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go. I was just starting to get bored myself.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Might as well have ourselves a picnic while we're at it.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"We load up on cured meat and military rations before heading out of the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"I follow Akari down the deserted hallways stained in the colors of the setting sun.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Come to think of it, why did you and Hotori enroll as students? Weren't you busy with the Sworn Blades?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To learn thy enemy, as they say.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono insisted that it was important for us to live amongst Republicans.”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Interesting. He really thought things through.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And it's only because of these strange times that I was able to be a student, as well.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thinking back on it, school sure was full of new and fun experiences.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"Akari looks fondly around at our surroundings.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, remember this classroom? It's where Elsa and I had that argument on my first day at school.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Like I'd ever forget. You just had to give me a headache even on your very first day.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks for standing up for me back then.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"We continue wandering the empty halls, stopping by place after place full of fond memories.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I never did get the chance to ask. Did you manage to get back all your memories?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, everything that happened in the two thousand years since you were born.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, more or less.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"There might still be a few parts missing, but it's nothing to worry about.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Does that mean you've met my mother?”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I've spoken to Empress Suou several times.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I... Or rather, Mitsurugi made a point of seeking an audience with every successive Emperor that acceded to the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would be a disaster if he couldn't secure the Emperor's cooperation when Kahaku reappeared to sow calamity.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Not to mention, the entire Imperial line is descended from Chihaya─from the Crystal of Life Himi-no-Mikoto created with Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Even if he had no business with them, he would still want to see them.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Then you knew me as well?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Since you were a child.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“He knew that you were special at first sight. Your face looked just like Himi-no-Mikoto's.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And so he implored Empress Suou to protect you, no matter what happened.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've had your eye on me since forever, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's why as soon as the Republic invaded, he went looking straight for you.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even though he really should have stayed and fought alongside Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see how it is. Guess I was the only one who thought fate conspired to bring us together.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I carried around these feelings for three whole years, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry for toying with your delicate heart.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, you'd better be.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you still have the hand towel Mitsurugi gave you back then?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course. It's my good-luck charm.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"After protecting Akari from the Republican Army, Mitsurugi faced Kahaku and was defeated.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Yet he was not bested in single combat.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Kahaku marshalled the Republican Army to strike at Mitsurugi from the skies.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Even then, Mitsurugi could still have withdrawn from the field of battle if he wanted to.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"However, someone unexpected suddenly appeared before him.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"His sister Tokita Kanami, with whom he'd shared a roof for many years.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"By all rights, he ought to have abandoned Kanami to her fate, but even Mitsurugi could not bear to be so callous.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"He did the only thing he could, and saved her from certain death at the hands of the Republic's bombs─",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"And in doing so, was reduced to mere scraps of flesh.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The next time he opened his eyes, he found himself in a room above Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Under orders from Okonogi, the manager had retrieved the pieces of Mitsurugi and restored him to life.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"However, the ordeal had erased all his memories.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"And so, he who was formerly Mitsurugi assumed a new identity, beginning life anew as Tokita Soujin.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"A perfectly blank slate, Hotori supported me every step of the way as I stumbled along my new life as a simple warrior.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"That was how I lived for three long years until that fateful day I was reunited with Akari.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Had the two of us never met, I'd surely still be leading my purposeless life as a papier-mache warrior.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's with that weird smile?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I truly am fortunate. To have been reunited with you.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Must've been the Founding Empress's guidance.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not to mention Mitsurugi's tenacity.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Had I not happened to pass by that exact spot the night Akari tried to assassinate Okonogi─",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The two of us would never have been reunited.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"All the stars in the sky needed to align for us to be here today.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"It could be nothing short of a miracle, wrought by the inseverable bond between Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Akari comes to a stop in front of the tallest peach tree in the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"This is the same spot Akari and I came to admire the Persica in spring.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Back then, you showed me your dance here.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Dance of Persica.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"We sit down next to each other on the lawn and turn our gazes upward.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Bereft of even a single dead leaf, the branches of the windswept tree grasp barrenly towards the twilit gray sky.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Want some?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gladly.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Akari offers me a handful of cured meat and a square of dense, hard-baked flour.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"It's a simple meal of military rations, intended for the sole purpose of providing sustenance.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I throw it into my mouth and slowly begin to chew.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"The desolate courtyard, the monochrome sky, the barren trees, this insipid meal─",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"All of it a dismal representation of the current state of Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Come tomorrow, we must do everything in our power to put an end to Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It sounded like Himi-no-Mikoto intended for you to seal Kahaku away.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah. While you take him on, I'll look for my chance to do that.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How are you going to seal him?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“W-Well, about that...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I know!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Basically, like, I'll make a prison of magicks and lock him away inside.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Akari makes the shape of a box with her hands, but I don't really get it.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"On the other hand, Akari appears to have gleaned a fundamental, intuitive understanding of magicks.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Much like blade arts, magicks seems to be a skill that must be grasped intuitively rather than explained with words.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"And Akari has undeniably inherited Himi-no-Mikoto's mastery.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just have to pin Kahaku down, right?”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yep, counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ideally, the seal works, but even if it doesn't, I have a backup plan.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Trading your life for his? Mitsurugi said the same thing.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I nod.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Because Kahaku and I are one and the same, neither of us can exist without the other.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"The two of us must either live as one, or die as one.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But then you'll...”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. We might not be able to attend the next Persica Blossom Festival together.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Akari's lips form a tight line.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Both Kahaku and I are an unwelcome inheritance from the Empire's founding two thousand years ago.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“His is to sow calamities, and mine is to cut them down in turn. It's as perverse as an undertaker who makes his own victims.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we'd never existed in the first place, there wouldn't need to be any calamities at all.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's only right for the two of us to disappear alongside Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stop it.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Even if you have to disappear, I don't wanna hear you talking about it like it's the right thing to do.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's not like you to be so sentimental.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm being sentimental?”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Here's what the old you would've said.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'My only purpose is to defeat Kahaku. If I must trade my life for his, then so be it.'”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, that does sound awfully like me.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Well, what do you know. I've been called an unfeeling simpleton all my life, yet now I'm being accused of being overly sentimental.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"I sure have changed.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Besides, hearing you say that you deserve to die will only make me want to cry!”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Make you cry?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Such a simple word is enough to pierce me to the core.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Am I making you sad?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isn't it freaking obvious?!”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"Akari glares at me, baring her teeth in anger.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Come to think of it, the two of us have never given voice to our feelings until now.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Indeed, we believed that doing so would shame ourselves as lord and warrior.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"All this time, we've done all we can to stifle our emotions and remain faithful to our duties.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Perhaps we've been trying our best to make ourselves into unfeeling tools.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry for making you sad.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's okay... I shouldn't have jumped down your throat like that.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sorry, too.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Akari murmurs dejectedly, looking down at the ground.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad you told me how you really felt.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I was just being selfish.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Here you are saying that you'll disappear for the sake of the Empire, yet all I'm doing is undermining your resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm a failure of a lord.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That makes two of us. I'm just as much a failure of a vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To tell the truth, when you were about to put the magatama around your neck, I wanted to stop you.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even though I didn't say it, deep down, I wanted so desperately to stop you.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I just barely held myself back in order to not tarnish the resolve of my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"How pathetic of me─",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"That my sense of duty is too feeble to conquer even my own emotions.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's true...”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...it makes me really happy.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure it was only because of you that my consciousness\ndidn't disappear after I merged with the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I really shouldn't be saying this after what the Founding Empress did for us...”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But still, I can't help how happy it makes me feel.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"Akari sidles up next to me.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Our shoulders touch, and I can feel her warmth.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"In the midst of this desolate winter, her presence alone is enough to fill me with the radiance of spring.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Could the mere presence of another possibly feel this warm?",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To me, you're like the sun.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not nearly as admirable as the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It has nothing to do with your deeds.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whenever I'm with you... my heart grows fonder and fonder.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-Where'd that come from? Are you feeling okay?”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Flustered, Akari lays a hand on my forehead.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Her hand feels irresistibly good.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"I seize her by the wrist.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hmm? What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think I'm losing my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Actually, I might've already lost it.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Squeezing her wrist tight, I pull Akari close and fold her in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sou... jin?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even though you're meant to be my lord, you're someone ever so dear to me.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Akari lets out a tiny gasp in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can't ever let you go.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Closer, closer still, I hold her against me.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"She doesn't resist.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"I gently push her down onto the soft grass.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"She says nothing.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"Her wide, round eyes stare unwaveringly into my soul.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"It's as though the girl of porcelain in my arms might shatter into pieces at my slightest touch.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know this is wrong, but...”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Enough of that, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're already failures as far as lords and servants are concerned.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It makes no difference if we take just one more step off the righteous path, does it?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"Akari truly is the sun in my sky.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"No matter how base my desires, she will always unconditionally accept me.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"I bear down on her slender body, burying my face in her neck.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"My lips brush against her smooth, delicate skin.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Just that is enough to cause Akari to let out a breathless gasp.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I love you, Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"With my lips still on her neck, I grope around for her hand.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"But before I get far, she entwines her hand with mine.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Her slender fingers nestle themselves in place between my crude digits.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin... I love you...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Akari's lovely chest heaves with each unsteady breath she takes.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"Oh, how dear she is to me.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look me in the eyes... and kiss me...”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"I raise my head as my lord commands─",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"And momentarily lose myself in those mesmerizing orbs of amaranth.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"As if to plunge headfirst into that pair of depthless springs, I bring our lips together as one.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nnh... nmm...”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Akari's lips are marvelously soft and warm.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"Her sultry breaths leak out and mingle with my own.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My head's going blank... I think I'm losing my mind.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Me too.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Slick with our combined saliva, Akari's lips quiver with barely-concealed longing.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your hands... they're trembling.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Akari's whisper tickles the inside of my ear.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm touching my lord's body. Of course I'd be nervous.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Forget about all that.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“For now, all of me belongs to you.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Wrapping her hands around my back, she hugs me even closer to her.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The fact you're touching me makes me really happy.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My heart's pounding so hard that I'm scared it's gonna give out... but I'm still so happy.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please, Soujin... Have your way with me.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Akari touches her forehead to mine.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"The tips of our noses brush against each other, and our breaths mingle in the afterglow of climax.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you think... we made a baby?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Being a tool created from magicks, I can't imagine I'm capable of siring a child.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Her life will pass me by in the twinkling of an eye as I live on through time unending.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Despite that─because of that, I can't help but think...",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"─How truly wonderful it would be if we managed to create a new life, conceived in our love.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we did, I could be no happier.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Really?”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"Akari shows me a blissful smile.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"It's a smile I've never seen before, the smile of someone who could want for nothing more in all the world.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"Am I truly capable of making someone smile like ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"this?",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"An indescribable warmth fills me from within.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"Even as the chill dusk of winter descends upon the courtyard, here beneath the shade of the Persica, it is as though spring has come.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"I wrap my arms tenderly around her.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let me stay like this for a while.”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, as long as you want.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"How delicate, how fragile this girl in my arms is.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"Yet with this body of hers, she accepted all of my desires and filled my heart with warmth.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"Truly, she is the sun in my sky.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"I will protect her─not out of duty, not out of obligation─but because I want to.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"This must be what it means to love another.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"For a long, long time, Akari and I bask in each other's warmth, finally separating to fix our disheveled clothes.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			{
"When she appears before me once more, my breath catches in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"Though she's clad in the same familiar clothes, she feels like a wholly different person than she was before we laid together.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Resplendent in the glow of the setting sun, she shines with a radiance several times─ several dozens of times─greater than before.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect you.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Where's this coming from all of a sudden?”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I want to protect you. I won't let anyone take away your radiance.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"The look of astonishment on her face soon gives way to a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That was sudden... But it makes me happy. Really happy.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're seriously offering, I just might take you up on that.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, please grant me this.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			{
"Only once I put it into words do I realize it─",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"I've finally found that which I want to protect, not out of duty or obligation, but of my own free will.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not that I can ever repay you, but still, I wanna tell you a secret.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My true name.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Now that she mentions it, “Miyaguni Akari” was just a pseudonym she took to blend in among the public.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Normally, we in the Imperial Family only reveal our true names to others in the bloodline.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've heard it's to avoid malicious curses.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you really okay with telling me?”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm telling you because it's you.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, if you don't care enough to hear it, then never mind, I guess.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tell me. Please.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-If you're that eager, it also makes it sorta awkward...”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"",
{"ruby", text="The Princess of Persica"},
"“Tsukisome-no-Himemiko.",
{"/ruby"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's my name.”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I turn it over in my head.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's a good name. It fits you perfectly.”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, should I start calling you Tsukisome-no-Himemiko from now on?”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Stick with Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tsukisome-no-Himemiko is a real mouthful, and besides...”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Akari is the name you fell in love with.”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"Akari smiles bashfully.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right... Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			{
"Even though none outside of her family are permitted to hear it, she still granted me the knowledge of her true name.",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			{
"For one who lives to serve the Imperial Family, there could be no higher honor.",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" protect Akari to the very end, no matter what.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"Hugging her close, I reaffirm my vow.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
